{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remnants of Lumira is a fast paced story-based 3D platformer with a retro aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up as a mouse named &quot;Furvolt&quot; unaware of your sense of time, but desperate to find answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple playable characters as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An expanding move set as the story progresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Unique Worlds with their own series of levels and aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engaging platforming gameplay accommodating for the casual 3d platforming fan, to the most seasoned veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret/multiple endings(?!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through a series of levels within 5 Worlds, where you unlock new abilities to better circumnavigate your environments, while also progressing through the story and unlocking new characters throughout your journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3259110?t=1744348769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744348769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259110/185f382829b8b960e07d63b1ffdb488f468b76db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744348769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259110/185f382829b8b960e07d63b1ffdb488f468b76db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744348769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"